\">出口；出路；出口；排气口</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">少</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>少；稍微；年少</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ショウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">すく.ない・すこ.し</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">少し</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">すこし</span><span class=\"k-wz\">少许；一点；一些；稍微；略微；片刻；一会儿；一小段时间；瞬间；短距离；一小段路程</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">少ない</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">すくない</span><span class=\"k-wz\">少；少量；数量少；低；稀少；不足；很少；罕见</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">少女</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おとめ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">少女；妙龄女子；姑娘</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">町</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>城镇；村庄；街区；街道</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">チョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">まち</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">町</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">まち</span><span class=\"k-wz\">城镇；街区；邻近地区；市中心；主干街道；街道；道路</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">下町</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">したまち</span><span class=\"k-wz\">城市低洼地区（通常包含商店、工厂等）；下町；东京下町（东京东部靠近东京湾的低洼地区，包括浅草、下谷、神田、深川、本所、日本桥、京桥及周边地区）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">料</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>费用；材料</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">リョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">料理</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">りょうり</span><span class=\"k-wz\">烹饪；烹调；菜肴；食物；菜；妥善处理；巧妙应对；打理；料理</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">食料品</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しょくりょうひん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">食品；食料；食品杂货</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">給料</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きゅうりょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">工资</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">工</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>工艺；工程；工业；工匠</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コウ・ク・グ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">工業</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうぎょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">工业；制造业</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">工場</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうじょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">工厂；工场；车间；作坊</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">人工</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じんこう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">人工的；人造的；人为的；人工；人为；技艺</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">建</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>建造；建立；设立</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ケン・コン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">た.てる・た.て・-だ.て・た.つ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">建物</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たてもの</span><span class=\"k-wz\">建筑物；房屋</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">建てる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たてる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">建造；构建</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">二階建て</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">にかいだて</span><span class=\"k-wz\">两层楼房；二层建筑</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">空</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>天空；空；空（无内容）；空（未使用）；空（空虚）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">クウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">そら・あ.く・あ.き・あ.ける・から・す.く・す.かす・むな.しい</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">空</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">から</span><span class=\"k-wz\">空虚；空洞；空无；空手的；不持任何东西的；无负担的；空头（票据、承诺等）；虚假的；爽约的；假装的（开心、勇气等）；空洞的（奉承话）；不诚实的</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">空く</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">打开；开启（如门等）；开张；开业（如商店等）；空着；闲置；空闲；有空；没人占用；敞开（如领口等）；（眼、嘴等）已睁开；张着；结束；终止；睁（眼）；张（嘴）；有洞；形成缝隙；间隔</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">空気</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">くうき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">空气；大气；气氛；氛围；存在感极弱的人；毫不起眼的人</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">止</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>停止；止住；阻止；停住；止</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">と.まる・-ど.まり・と.める・-と.める・-ど.め・とど.める・とど.め・とど.まる・や.める・や.む・-や.む・よ.す・-さ.す・-さ.し</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">止まる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">とどまる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">停留；驻留；留在原地；局限于；限制在；仅限于</span></li><