\">キ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">お.きる・お.こる・お.こす・おこ.す・た.つ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">起きる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おきる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">起床；起立；燃烧；醒来；保持清醒；发生；出现</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">起す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おこす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">抬起；举起；竖起；拾起；唤醒；叫醒；弄醒；引起；导致；造成；触发；产生（如热、电等）；引发；开始；启动；创办；建立；开设；开张；耕；犁；耕耘；患上；得（病）；誊写；记录（口述内容）；翻动（卡牌）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">起こる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おこる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">发生；出现</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">着</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>穿；到达；附着；戴；套（衣物）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">チャク・ジャク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">き.る・き.せる・つ.く・つ.ける</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">上着</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">うわぎ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">外套；夹克；外衣；上衣；上身衣服</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">着る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">穿（从肩部往下）；穿上；着装；承担（责任、过错）；担负</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">着く</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">つく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">到达；抵达；坐在；就座于（桌旁等）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">店</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>店铺；商店</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">テン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">みせ・たな</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li>